as?","Es regnet, hast du einen Schirm?","It's raining, do you have an umbrella?"],["está nublado","expr","es ist bewölkt","it's cloudy","está nublado","Está nublado, pero no llueve.","Es ist bewölkt, aber es regnet nicht.","It's cloudy, but it's not raining."],["la lluvia","f","der Regen","rain","a chuva","La lluvia llega por la tarde.","Der Regen kommt am Nachmittag.","The rain comes in the afternoon."],["el paraguas","m","der Regenschirm","umbrella","o guarda-chuva","No olvides el paraguas.","Vergiss den Regenschirm nicht.","Don't forget the umbrella."],["los grados","m","die Grad","degrees","os graus","Hoy hay treinta grados.","Heute sind es dreißig Grad.","It's thirty degrees today."],["estoy bien","expr","mir geht's gut","I'm fine","estou bem","Estoy bien, gracias.","Mir geht's gut, danke.","I'm fine, thanks."],["feliz","adj","glücklich","happy","feliz","Estoy feliz con mi nuevo trabajo.","Ich bin glücklich mit meiner neuen Arbeit.","I'm happy with my new job."],["contento / contenta","adj","froh; zufrieden","glad; pleased","contente","Estoy contenta de verte.","Ich freue mich, dich zu sehen.","I'm glad to see you."],["triste","adj","traurig","sad","triste","Hoy estoy un poco triste.","Heute bin ich ein bisschen traurig.","Today I'm a bit sad."],["cansado / cansada","adj","müde","tired","cansado/a","Estoy cansada después del trabajo.","Ich bin müde nach der Arbeit.","I'm tired after work."],["nervioso / nerviosa","adj","nervös","nervous","nervoso/a","Estoy nerviosa antes del examen.","Ich bin nervös vor der Prüfung.","I'm nervous before the exam."],["enojado / enojada","adj","wütend; verärgert","angry","bravo/a; irritado/a","¿Por qué estás enojado?","Warum bist du wütend?","Why are you angry?"],["tranquilo / tranquila","adj","ruhig; entspannt","calm; relaxed","tranquilo/a","Tranquila, todo está bien.","Ganz ruhig, alles ist gut.","Relax, everything's fine."],["aburrido / aburrida","adj","gelangweilt","bored","entediado/a","Estoy aburrida en casa.","Mir ist zu Hause langweilig.","I'm bored at home."],["preocupado / preocupada","adj","besorgt","worried","preocupado/a","Estoy preocupada por mi hermana.","Ich mache mir Sorgen um meine Schwester.","I'm worried about my sister."],["tengo hambre","expr","ich habe Hunger","I'm hungry","estou com fome","Tengo hambre, ¿comemos tacos?","Ich habe Hunger, essen wir Tacos?","I'm hungry, shall we have tacos?"],["tengo sed","expr","ich habe Durst","I'm thirsty","estou com sede","Tengo sed, quiero agua.","Ich habe Durst, ich möchte Wasser.","I'm thirsty, I want water."],["tengo sueño","expr","ich bin müde (schläfrig)","I'm sleepy","estou com sono","Tengo sueño, me voy a dormir.","Ich bin müde, ich gehe schlafen.","I'm sleepy, I'm going to bed."],["de buen humor / de mal humor","expr","gut gelaunt / schlecht gelaunt","in a good / bad mood","de bom / mau humor","Hoy está de buen humor.","Heute ist sie gut gelaunt.","Today she's in a good mood."]]